1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,005
Interviews feel awkward when you pitch too early.

2
00:00:03,005 --> 00:00:03,756
Ask first.

3
00:00:03,756 --> 00:00:04,507
Sell later.

4
00:00:04,507 --> 00:00:07,136
This lesson is about interview without awkwardness.

5
00:00:07,136 --> 00:00:09,014
Five questions that reveal pain.

6
00:00:09,014 --> 00:00:11,644
Do not treat this as theory only.

7
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:15,400
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:21,034
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

9
00:00:21,034 --> 00:00:25,165
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

10
00:00:25,165 --> 00:00:30,048
Stay practical: run one practice interview script before you optimize branding or tools.

11
00:00:30,368 --> 00:00:37,659
Five questions: what is hard, how often, what it costs them, what they tried, and what a win would look like.

12
00:00:37,659 --> 00:00:40,437
Remember the objective: run one practice interview script.

13
00:00:40,437 --> 00:00:44,256
